flowchart TD
    A[Strict preflight: scenario and externally trusted policy] --> B{Preflight valid?}
    B -->|No| C[VALIDATION_REJECTED: no core ticks]
    B -->|Yes| D[Immutable eligible batch at T_k]
    D --> E[Normalize full batch: RF and control conflicts]
    E --> F[Pure state decision from pre-snapshot]
    F --> G[Validate bounded virtual output and serialize JCS tick record]
    G --> H{Trace append success?}
    H -->|No| I[FAILED_INCOMPLETE_EVIDENCE: output not published]
    H -->|Yes| J[Publish one committed post-state and virtual output]
    J --> K{More ticks?}
    K -->|Yes| D
    K -->|No| L[Append terminal without self-digest]
    L --> M[External report with control_trace_sha256]
